/// <summary>
/// Stations players use, meaning the level's dice tables, smithies, alchemy tables, drying racks
/// and smokehouses, and interactive prefabs placed by scripts. SmartObject.stations lists stations
/// per dimension. SmartObject.remove uses a level edit to hide one in a dimension, take it off
/// lists there and block new sessions, while active sessions can finish. Removing it from the
/// global dimension removes it from all. Like other level edits, this is not saved, and
/// SmartObject.restore reverses it. SmartObject.spawn places a bench, bed, dice table, or crafting,
/// drying or smoking station, which each client in the dimension builds whole from the game's
/// prefab, including furniture, solids and interaction entities. smartObject.toJSON() gives the
/// definition for placing it again. (Server only.)
