/// <summary>
/// Dice matches at the game's dice tables, on the game's dice screen. The server makes each throw
/// and checks each move by the game's scoring, with dice perks off. Players can use the game's dice
/// kinds and badges. A match ends when a banked score reaches the target, or with gaveUp, left,
/// timedOut (3 minutes without a move), failed or stopped. Players within 20 m can watch. A player
/// can first take one of a table's two chairs to wait with Dice.sit, and a match between those two
/// plays from their chairs, leaving them seated. Events are diceTableUse(player, table, match),
/// diceMatchStart, diceTurnStart, diceMove, diceTurnEnd, and diceMatchEnd(match, first, second,
